      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "這門課目標瞭解各種使用 socket API 的裝置並設計穩定傳輸的網路程式，目前很多protocol使用於Linux OS，例如 PF_INET, PF_INET6, PF_UNIX, PF_PACKET, PF_NETLINK,PF_BLUETOOTH, PF_CAN (CAN BUS), and PF_IEEE802154。很多裝置透過不同的 protocol socket API 相互溝通，設計穩定的網路程式是重要的課題。",
      "describe_en": "The course covers the basic and advanced issues of socket programming such as multiple processes, I/O multiplexing, multi-threaded processes, multicasting and secure network programming. Application examples such as Internet browsing, proxy and file transfer are discussed.\r\n\r\nProcess stability is an important issue.",
